### Accounts Payable - All bills
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/accounts-payable/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter by bill date range
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/accounts-payable/?date_from=2026-10-01&date_to=2026-10-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search bill number or vendor
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/accounts-payable/?search=ABC
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter by vendor
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/accounts-payable/?vendor_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter overdue bills
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/accounts-payable/?status=overdue
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter paid bills
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/accounts-payable/?status=paid
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter partially paid bills
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/accounts-payable/?status=partially_paid
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter unpaid bills
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/accounts-payable/?status=unpaid
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/accounts-payable/?page=1&page_size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Combine filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/accounts-payable/?date_from=2026-10-01&date_to=2026-10-31&vendor_id=1&status=overdue&search=ABC&page=1&page_size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
